siness_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yIy70vHKF_L3Gy1cu2Wqwg","review_id":"a5-FwPUK59nWLf8v_QqN1g","date":"2020-02-09T18:42:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9325138330459595,"text_excerpt":"We were here for happy hour basically just to get out of the cold for a while and it happened to be a great find. The house wines were on special for $7 a glass and there was a happy hour small plate menu. We chose the cabernet and cauliflower and the shrimp cocktail. The food was amazing. The cauliflower was huge for the price and so good with a sweet sauce and peanuts in it. The bartenders and servers were all very nice. The restroom is far from the bar, but it's super nice and clean. Probably the cleanest one in New Orleans."},{"business_id":"yIy70vHKF_L3Gy1cu2Wqwg","review_id":"Q9D3atTeFhPjn1SBfr2EcQ","date":"2021-11-23T15:31:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9324012398719788,"text_excerpt":"We were walking towards the Orpheum and my bf said he was hungry so we stopped to look at the menu. One of the servers opened the door and handed us the menu. He then asked for COVID vaccination cards and said we could sit at the bar. We ordered quickly because we were on our way to see the Louisiana Philharmonic on opening night. We ordered the BBQ shrimp, gumbo, and two glasses of wine. The food was unexpectedly amazing. I mean, we had no idea what we were in for because we were just passing by and the restaurant is located inside a hotel. Service was wonderful and this was hands down one of the best shrimp dishes I tried in New Orleans. The gumbo was pretty good as well, but fairly sta..."},{"business_id":"yIy70vHKF_L3Gy1cu2Wqwg","review_id":"cHLwfRKqI9-k1VCHu41fEQ","date":"2020-02-29T00:46:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9235163927078247,"text_excerpt":"4 years ago I met my fiancé in this location, it was a horrible restaurant and now it was replaced by this really cool place! We came for happy hour and it was so much fun! The cauliflower is delicious and a must, you simply have to order it. The fries are really good and the beef of the burger is outstanding. I didn't love the redfish spread. We also ordered the blue corn cake as a dessert, the crunchy corn with mascarpone is amazing, this is not an indulgent dessert but it is unique, beautiful and tasty."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yIy70vHKF_L3Gy1cu2Wqwg","photo_id":"CH4CQOLql4yoiqHnjnsE8Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CH4CQOLql4yoiqHnjnsE8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9421498775482178},{"business_id":"yIy70vHKF_L3Gy1cu2Wqwg","photo_id":"ZZ1pu0JhbmBOnSOcLAjSJg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZZ1pu0JhbmBOnSOcLAjSJg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9226100444793701},{"business_id":"yIy70vHKF_L3Gy1cu2Wqwg","photo_id":"_8XVKrN4vC75QCbCwq68qQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_8XVKrN4vC75QCbCwq68qQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9118748307228088},{"business_id":"yIy70vHKF_L3Gy1cu2Wqwg","photo_id":"_K6j60DkYc8XabtgRDGcNg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_K6j60DkYc8XabtgRDGcNg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9085779190063477}]},"notebook_case":null}
